# What Prettier does not format, and why.
#
# node_modules is skipped by Prettier already; the rest are build output, the
# generated player bundle, and the coverage report.
node_modules
dist
coverage
../pkg/gui/dist

# Markdown and the docs are linted by rumdl (mise run lint:docs) and Vale
# (mise run lint:prose), which wrap prose deliberately. Prettier reflowing it
# would fight both and produce a diff with no reviewer.
*.md
../README.md
../docs
../pkg/gui/docs